msgid "What is Qiskit? This document provides an introduction to the Qiskit stack."
msgstr "Qiskit とは何でしょうか。このドキュメントでは、Qiskit スタックの概要を紹介します。"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit"
msgstr "Qiskit の紹介"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
